<main class="deal-workspace catalog-import">
  <header class="deal-page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">Library · controlled import</p><h1>Review a product catalog</h1><p>Rubusoo extracts candidates first. Nothing enters Library until you approve it.</p></div></header>
  <%= form_with model: @batch, class: "import-dropzone" do |form| %><div><strong>CSV or text-based PDF</strong><p>CSV is parsed deterministically. PDF content is preserved for review and never creates products silently.</p></div><%= form.file_field :source_files, multiple: true, accept: ".csv,.pdf" %><%= form.submit "Analyze files", class: "button button--primary" %><% end %>
  <aside class="import-guardrails"><span>Import guardrails</span><ul><li>Formula-like cells are neutralized.</li><li>Missing prices stay missing.</li><li>Matches are suggestions, not automatic merges.</li></ul></aside>
</main>
